* A root of x*3 - 2·x - 5 = 0 by halving the interval it lies in.
* Part 2 is the function. s is its sign at the left-hand end.
1.1 Do part 2 for x = (a+b)/2.
1.2 Type a, b in form 1.
1.3 Set b = x if sgn(y) ≠ s.
1.4 Set a = x if sgn(y) = s.
